sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant LangProc as LanguageProcessor
    participant ReasonProc as ReasoningProcessor
    participant ToolProc as ToolProcessor
    participant MemProc as MemoryProcessor
    participant Holofield

    User->>LangProc: Input text
    LangProc->>Holofield: Store language engram
    LangProc->>ReasonProc: Process query
    ReasonProc->>MemProc: Check memory
    MemProc->>Holofield: Retrieve engrams
    Holofield-->>MemProc: Return memories
    MemProc->>Holofield: Store retrieval engram
    MemProc-->>ReasonProc: Memory results
    ReasonProc->>ToolProc: Use tool
    ToolProc->>ToolProc: Execute
    ToolProc->>Holofield: Store tool engram
    ToolProc-->>ReasonProc: Tool result
    ReasonProc->>Holofield: Store reasoning engram
    ReasonProc->>LangProc: Generate response
    LangProc->>Holofield: Store response engram
    LangProc-->>User: Response